1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. d3 { C24 Bishop's Opening: Vienna Hybrid } 4... Be7 5. f4 d6 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. O-O { We want to invite Nd4. Why? } 7... Nd4 { Same as chapter 3 before our move 7, except we Have O-O and they have Be7. Same idea anyway! } 8. fxe5 dxe5 9. Bxf7+ Kf8 { Most take, but this was the only good move! } 10. Bb3 Bxf3 11. gxf3 Qd6 12. f4 Qb6 13. Be3 { fxe5 is good too } 13... Nf3+ 14. Qxf3 { Black resigns. } 14... Bc5 15. fxe5 Bxe3+ 16. Kh1 Bc5 1-0


